	(text "microSD: P4 SDMMC slot 0, 4-bit (GPIO39-44), I/O from the module's ESP_LDO_VO4 (SD_VIO), 10k pull-ups.\nCard power: 3V3_SD (shunt RS405, PM2 CH3) -> AO3401A, GPIO45 low = on (as reference). Detect -> expander P5.\nTCA6408A (0x20): P0 EN_LCD, P1 EN_ETH, P2 EN_GPS, P3 EN_M1421, P4 USBA_EN (100k pull-downs: all off at reset),\nP5 SD_DET (input), P6 GPS_RESET_N, P7 M1421_NRST (both: output low = reset, input = released). INT -> GPIO53."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "46ed9b5c-29a7-4e8a-9152-f89fcfb6f18e")
	)
